  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "\"No cap\" is `CalcMaxLevel` 0 (with `CalcMinLevel` 0 unless given). The three templates (`DLC1EncVampireTemplate` 003373, `…Magic` 003372, `…Missile` 003374, \"Vampire Court Member\") are never placed.",
      "Changing `DLC1EncVampireTemplate` 003373:Dawnguard.esm changes Hestla and Rargal only: Fura, Modhna and Salonia use it as their template but not for `Stats`, and so do the other two templates, `…Magic` 003372 and `…Missile` 003374.",
      "Changing `DLC1EncVampireTemplateMagic` 003372:Dawnguard.esm changes Feran, Malkus (both records) and Vingalmo only: Garan, Namasur, Ronthil and Stalf use it as their template but not for `Stats`. `…Missile` 003374 sets Orthjolf alone.",
      "Changing `TreasCorpseCommonerNordMale` 045804 also changes the Watchman and the corpses, beggars and thrall templates that take `Stats` from it; no record keeps its own level beside it.",
      "Lokil owns no level: he takes `Stats` from `LCharVampireBossDLC1MaleVampireNordM` 00F4FE:Dawnguard.esm (the Nord boss ladder, on *Vampire Boss*), so changing that list moves him.",
      "Every row: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "The vampire-race records with no template (`EncVampire00Template` 032FE7 on *Common Vampires*; Hern, Hert and Sybille Stentor on *Unique Vampires*) are not court members."
    ]
  },
